WEBVTT

00:05:28.079 --> 00:05:34.538
Only 6 is on the list of possible sums,
so B would again know that A had 6.

00:05:35.038 --> 00:05:37.704
To summarize, if A had 6,

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:41.329
he still wouldn’t know whether
B had 5 or 8.

00:05:41.788 --> 00:05:45.038
That contradicts the second half 
of what B said,

00:05:45.038 --> 00:05:48.704
and 5 and 4 must be the correct codes.

00:05:49.413 --> 00:05:52.413
With seconds to spare you override 
the missile launch,

00:05:52.413 --> 00:05:54.621
shoot yourself out of the torpedo bay,

00:05:54.621 --> 00:05:57.204
and send the sub 
to the bottom of the ocean.